000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. PRMCALC.
000300 AUTHOR. CORVANE MAINFRAME BILLING.
000400*================================================================
000500* PRMCALC  NIGHTLY PREMIUM CALCULATION           PRMNIGHT STEP020
000600*
000700* FOR EACH POLICY ON CORV.PRM.EXTRACT (POLREC):
000800*   1. CALL THE LINE'S RATING PROGRAM, NAMED 'RAT' + LINE + '01'
000900*      (DYNAMIC CALL, E.G. RATMTR01, RATHOM01).
001000*   2. CALL PRMRULES FOR THE UNDERWRITING RULE TABLE.
001100*   3. APPLY THE EXCESS (3000-APPLY-EXCESS).
001200*   4. WORK OUT THE NET PREMIUM FOR THE BILLING PERIOD.
001300*   5. CALL IPTCALC FOR INSURANCE PREMIUM TAX.
001400* WRITES CORV.PRM.RATED (RATEREC) FOR PRMBILL.
001500*
001600* NOTE: THE SAME EXCESS RULE IS CODED IN JAVA (policy-admin
001700* RatingService.applyExcess) AND IN claims-service
001800* (ClaimSettlementCalculator). THEY HAVE DRIFTED - SEE 3000.
001900*
002000* CHANGE LOG
002100* 2014-06 ORIGINAL.
002200* 2017-04 COMPULSORY EXCESS RAISED 150 -> 200 (MEMO UW-2017-04).
002300* 2021-09 DYNAMIC CALL OF RAT<LINE>01 REPLACES THE OLD EVALUATE.
002400* 2022-02 ARANDHAN: PRMRULES KO HAR POLICY KE LIYE BULAYA JATA
