006000     05  WS-VOL-DISC-PCT         PIC 9(03)V99.
006100     05  WS-EXCESS-DISCOUNT      PIC S9(07)V99 COMP-3.
006200 01  WS-MIN-PREMIUM              PIC 9(03)V99 VALUE 25.00.
006300 01  WS-REFER-SCORE              PIC 9(03) VALUE 850.
006400 01  WS-COUNTERS.
