007000 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
007100 0000-MAIN.
007200     PERFORM 1000-INITIALISE
007300     PERFORM 2000-RATE-POLICY UNTIL WS-EOF
007400     PERFORM 9000-TERMINATE
007500     GOBACK.
007600 1000-INITIALISE.
007700     OPEN INPUT EXTRACT-FILE PARM-FILE
007800          OUTPUT RATED-FILE
007900*    ONLY RUNDATE= IS READ FROM PRMPARM01. THE EXCESS-COMP= CARD
008000*    IN THAT MEMBER IS NOT READ BY THIS PROGRAM (SEE 3000).
008100     PERFORM UNTIL WS-PARM-EOF
008200         READ PARM-FILE
008300             AT END SET WS-PARM-EOF TO TRUE
008400             NOT AT END
008500                 IF PARM-CARD(1:8) = 'RUNDATE='
008600                    AND PARM-CARD(9:6) NOT = '*TODAY'
008700                     MOVE PARM-CARD(9:8) TO WS-RUN-DATE
008800                 END-IF
008900         END-READ
009000     END-PERFORM
009100     IF WS-RUN-DATE = ZERO
009200         ACCEPT WS-RUN-DATE FROM DATE YYYYMMDD
009300     END-IF
009400     PERFORM 8000-READ-EXTRACT.
009500 2000-RATE-POLICY.
009600     ADD 1 TO WS-READ-CNT
009700     INITIALIZE RATE-RECORD
009800     MOVE POL-NUMBER         TO RATE-POL-NUMBER
009900     MOVE POL-LINE-CODE      TO RATE-LINE-CODE
010000     MOVE POL-REGION         TO RATE-REGION
010100     MOVE POL-CURRENCY       TO RATE-CURRENCY
010200     MOVE WS-RUN-DATE        TO RATE-BILL-DATE
010300     MOVE POL-BILL-FREQ      TO RATE-BILL-FREQ
010400     MOVE 'N'                TO RATE-REFER-FLAG
010500     STRING 'RAT' POL-LINE-CODE '01' DELIMITED BY SIZE
010600         INTO WS-RATING-PGM
010700     CALL WS-RATING-PGM USING POL-RECORD RATE-RECORD
010800         ON EXCEPTION
010900             SET RATE-NO-RATING-PGM TO TRUE
011000             SET RATE-REFER TO TRUE
011100             ADD 1 TO WS-NOPGM-CNT
011200             DISPLAY 'PRMCALC: NO RATING PROGRAM ' WS-RATING-PGM
011300                     ' FOR ' POL-NUMBER
011400     END-CALL
011500     IF RATE-OK
011600         CALL 'PRMRULES' USING POL-RECORD RATE-RECORD
011700         PERFORM 3000-APPLY-EXCESS
011800         PERFORM 4000-NET-PREMIUM
011900         CALL 'IPTCALC' USING RATE-LINE-CODE RATE-REGION
012000                              RATE-NET-PREMIUM RATE-IPT-RATE
012100                              RATE-IPT-AMT
012200     END-IF
012300     IF RATE-REFER
012400         ADD 1 TO WS-REFER-CNT
012500     END-IF
012600     WRITE RATED-REC FROM RATE-RECORD
012700     ADD 1 TO WS-RATED-CNT
012800     PERFORM 8000-READ-EXTRACT.
012900 3000-APPLY-EXCESS.
013000*    COMPULSORY EXCESS IS 200 (MEMO UW-2017-04). THE JAVA RATING
013100*    SERVICE AND THE CLAIMS SERVICE USE 250 SINCE 2024; THIS
013200*    PROGRAM WAS NEVER CHANGED. PRMPARM01 SAYS EXCESS-COMP=250
013300*    BUT IT IS NOT READ HERE.
013400*    VOLUNTARY EXCESS EARNS 5% DISCOUNT PER 100, AT MOST 20%.
013500*    ROUNDED IS HALF-UP (AWAY FROM ZERO) ON THIS COMPILER.
013600     MOVE WS-COMPULSORY-EXCESS TO RATE-EXCESS-COMPULSORY
013700     MOVE POL-VOLUNTARY-EXCESS TO RATE-EXCESS-VOLUNTARY
013800     COMPUTE WS-TOTAL-EXCESS = WS-COMPULSORY-EXCESS
013900                             + POL-VOLUNTARY-EXCESS
014000     COMPUTE WS-VOL-DISC-PCT = (POL-VOLUNTARY-EXCESS / 100) * 5
014100     IF WS-VOL-DISC-PCT > 20
014200         MOVE 20 TO WS-VOL-DISC-PCT
014300     END-IF
014400     COMPUTE WS-EXCESS-DISCOUNT ROUNDED =
014500         RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * WS-VOL-DISC-PCT / 100
014600     ADD WS-EXCESS-DISCOUNT TO RATE-DISCOUNTS.
014700 4000-NET-PREMIUM.
014800     COMPUTE RATE-NET-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
014900         RATE-BASE-PREMIUM + RATE-LOADINGS - RATE-DISCOUNTS
015000     IF RATE-NET-PREMIUM < WS-MIN-PREMIUM
015100         MOVE WS-MIN-PREMIUM TO RATE-NET-PREMIUM
015200     END-IF
015300     IF RATE-BILL-FREQ = 'M'
015400         COMPUTE RATE-NET-PREMIUM ROUNDED = RATE-NET-PREMIUM / 12
015500     END-IF
015600     IF POL-RISK-SCORE > WS-REFER-SCORE
015700         SET RATE-REFER TO TRUE
015800     END-IF.
015900 8000-READ-EXTRACT.
016000     READ EXTRACT-FILE
016100         AT END SET WS-EOF TO TRUE
016200     END-READ.
016300 9000-TERMINATE.
016400     CLOSE EXTRACT-FILE PARM-FILE RATED-FILE
016500     MOVE WS-RATED-CNT TO WS-DISPLAY-CNT
016600     DISPLAY 'PRMCALC POLICIES RATED     ' WS-DISPLAY-CNT
016700     MOVE WS-REFER-CNT TO WS-DISPLAY-CNT
016800     DISPLAY 'PRMCALC REFERRED           ' WS-DISPLAY-CNT
016900     MOVE WS-NOPGM-CNT TO WS-DISPLAY-CNT
017000     DISPLAY 'PRMCALC NO RATING PROGRAM  ' WS-DISPLAY-CNT
017100     IF WS-NOPGM-CNT > ZERO
017200         MOVE 4 TO RETURN-CODE
017300     END-IF.
